{
  "_comment": "The DRAFTING profile, used only by agents/draft.sh. It can create Gmail drafts and nothing else. Every tool that transmits is denied here as well as in settings.json — there is no profile anywhere in this repo that permits sending. David's instruction, 2026-09-08: 'never send anything just create drafts'.",
